<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"><ttm:name type="full">asmi</ttm:name></ttm:agent><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Rin音</songwriter><songwriter>asmi</songwriter><songwriter>Henrii</songwriter></songwriters><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">即使地球毁灭了</text><text for="L2">我们仍歌声不断</text><text for="L3">唱的真差劲</text><text for="L4">不论事情变得怎样都无所谓了</text><text for="L5">如果我们二人相伴</text><text for="L6">不论是陨石划破天际落下 或是晴朗的好天气</text><text for="L7">都笑对这一切 我们真是笨蛋呢</text><text for="L8">“继续沉浸在梦乡里 男孩 如何呢”</text><text for="L9">越过无线对讲机的对话 不自觉地窝火</text><text for="L10">时间是十点整 今天也在这里（地球）</text><text for="L11">赶不上宇宙飞船 原因：贪睡</text><text for="L12">大家都在赶忙地移居别的星球 而我现在还在地球</text><text for="L13">她也没有赶上飞船 我渴望你</text><text for="L14">朴素的服装 无聊的生活</text><text for="L15">或许这样还挺不错的 因为啊</text><text for="L16">在只有你我的主题公园</text><text for="L17">尽情地喧闹</text><text for="L18">在夜晚 两人去往便利店</text><text for="L19">坏人和不良少年们 都不在了</text><text for="L20">在充满戏剧性的影院</text><text for="L21">播放昨天的电影</text><text for="L22">终有一天 我会向你求婚</text><text for="L23">将地球献给你</text><text for="L24">或许这一切都会让我羞涩难当</text><text for="L25">因尴尬显得动作生硬</text><text for="L26">拍下你我照片的相册</text><text for="L27">或许可以做成一亿册</text><text for="L28">相册的事差不多先这样</text><text for="L29">今天就先睡吧</text><text for="L30">即使地球毁灭了</text><text for="L31">我们仍歌声不断</text><text for="L32">唱的真差劲</text><text for="L33">不论事情变得怎样都无所谓了</text><text for="L34">如果我们二人相伴</text><text for="L35">不论是陨石划破天际落下 或是晴朗的好天气</text><text for="L36">都笑对这一切 我们真是笨蛋呢</text><text for="L37">不过 我好像已经对你厌倦了</text><text for="L38">爱情洋溢的日子也已结束了</text><text for="L39">笨蛋 你要睡到什么时候</text><text for="L40">我一边捏着你的脸 发泄情绪</text><text for="L41">呐 你在做什么？让我看看 快让我看看</text><text for="L42">我一直藏着不让你看的</text><text for="L43">是我为你做的花冠</text><text for="L44">不愿移居的你</text><text for="L45">我们住在四季轮回的星球</text><text for="L46">流星群就是我们的救世主</text><text for="L47">谢谢 再见人类</text><text for="L48">两人一同迎来黑夜的拂晓</text><text for="L49">最后的清晨 定会是这样的感觉</text><text for="L50">就算这世界迎来终结</text><text for="L51">也请你不要离开我的身边</text><text for="L52">一定 一定哦</text><text for="L53">不论事情变得怎样都无所谓了</text><text for="L54">如果我们二人相伴</text><text for="L55">不论是陨石划破天际落下 或是晴朗的好天气</text><text for="L56">都笑对这一切</text><text for="L57">就让我们相伴余生</text><text for="L58">这好似一句玩笑</text><text for="L59">在我们无法欢笑的日子里 看着流星划过天空</text><text for="L60">真漂亮呀</text><text for="L61">不论事情变得怎样都无所谓了</text><text for="L62">不论发生什么 就让你我相伴</text><text for="L63">不论是陨石划破天际落下 或是晴朗的好天气</text><text for="L64">都笑对这一切 我们真是笨蛋呢</text><text for="L65">就算这世界迎来终结 也要如此</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body><div itunes:song-part="Verse"><p begin="0:02.138" end="0:04.606" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:02.138" end="0:02.621">Even</span> <span begin="0:02.621" end="0:02.957">if</span> <span begin="0:02.957" end="0:03.125">the</span> <span begin="0:03.125" end="0:03.629">earth</span> <span begin="0:03.629" end="0:03.885">is</span> <span begin="0:03.885" end="0:04.606">broken</span></p><p begin="0:04.606" end="0:07.721" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:04.606" end="0:05.171">私</span><span begin="0:05.171" end="0:05.533">達</span><span begin="0:05.533" end="0:05.697">ず</span><span begin="0:05.697" end="0:05.861">っ</span><span begin="0:05.861" end="0:06.117">と</span><span begin="0:06.117" end="0:06.443">歌</span><span begin="0:06.443" end="0:06.589">っ</span><span begin="0:06.589" end="0:06.711">て</span><span begin="0:06.711" end="0:06.833">い</span><span begin="0:06.833" end="0:07.095">よ</span><span begin="0:07.095" end="0:07.357">う</span><span begin="0:07.357" end="0:07.721">よ</span></p><p begin="0:07.721" end="0:13.006" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:07.721" end="0:09.857">Hoohoohoo</span><span begin="0:09.857" end="0:10.025">ヘ</span><span begin="0:10.025" end="0:10.161">タ</span><span begin="0:10.161" end="0:10.311">ク</span><span begin="0:10.311" end="0:10.469">ソ</span><span begin="0:10.469" end="0:10.746">ね</span><span begin="0:10.746" end="0:13.006">hoohoohoo</span></p></div><div itunes:song-part="Chorus"><p begin="0:13.662" end="0:16.129" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:13.662" end="0:13.875">ど</span><span begin="0:13.875" end="0:14.088">う</span><span begin="0:14.088" end="0:14.194">な</span><span begin="0:14.194" end="0:14.300">っ</span><span begin="0:14.301" end="0:14.459">た</span><span begin="0:14.459" end="0:14.617">っ</span><span begin="0:14.617" end="0:14.809">て</span><span begin="0:14.809" end="0:15.001">い</span><span begin="0:15.002" end="0:15.194">い</span><span begin="0:15.194" end="0:15.541">や</span> <span begin="0:15.541" end="0:15.787">も</span><span begin="0:15.787" end="0:16.129">う</span></p><p begin="0:16.305" end="0:19.537" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:16.305" end="0:16.762">私</span><span begin="0:16.762" end="0:17.168">達</span><span begin="0:17.168" end="0:17.329">き</span><span begin="0:17.329" end="0:17.490">っ</span><span begin="0:17.490" end="0:17.697">と</span><span begin="0:17.697" end="0:18.085">2</span><span begin="0:18.085" end="0:18.313">人</span><span begin="0:18.313" end="0:18.717">な</span><span begin="0:18.717" end="0:19.089">ら</span><span begin="0:19.089" end="0:19.537">さ</span></p><p begin="0:19.537" end="0:22.120" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:19.537" end="0:19.800">隕</span><span begin="0:19.800" end="0:20.137">石</span><span begin="0:20.137" end="0:20.307">だ</span><span begin="0:20.307" end="0:20.477">っ</span><span begin="0:20.477" end="0:20.696">て</span><span begin="0:20.696" end="0:20.916">良</span><span begin="0:20.916" end="0:21.136">い</span><span begin="0:21.137" end="0:21.376">天</span><span begin="0:21.376" end="0:21.566">気</span><span begin="0:21.566" end="0:21.741">だ</span><span begin="0:21.741" end="0:21.916">っ</span><span begin="0:21.916" end="0:22.120">て</span></p><p begin="0:22.120" end="0:25.522" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:22.120" end="0:22.472">笑</span><span begin="0:22.472" end="0:22.652">っ</span><span begin="0:22.653" end="0:22.841">て</span><span begin="0:22.841" end="0:23.059">な</span><span begin="0:23.059" end="0:23.328">が</span><span begin="0:23.328" end="0:23.524">せ</span><span begin="0:23.524" end="0:24.354">る</span> <span begin="0:24.354" end="0:24.532">馬</span><span begin="0:24.532" end="0:24.840">鹿</span><span begin="0:24.840" end="0:24.984">だ</span><span begin="0:24.984" end="0:25.522">な</span></p></div><div itunes:song-part="Verse"><p begin="0:25.845" end="0:29.029" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:26.005" end="0:26.300">Over</span> <span begin="0:26.300" end="0:26.657">sleep</span> <span begin="0:26.657" end="0:27.961">boy</span> <span begin="0:27.961" end="0:28.490">如何</span><span begin="0:28.490" end="0:28.745">か</span><span begin="0:28.745" end="0:29.029">な</span></p><p begin="0:29.029" end="0:32.025" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:29.029" end="0:29.182">無</span><span begin="0:29.182" end="0:29.403">線</span><span begin="0:29.403" end="0:29.641">機</span><span begin="0:29.641" end="0:30.157">越</span><span begin="0:30.157" end="0:30.885">し</span> <span begin="0:30.885" end="0:31.319">腹</span><span begin="0:31.319" end="0:31.525">た</span><span begin="0:31.525" end="0:31.714">つ</span><span begin="0:31.714" end="0:32.025">わ</span></p><p begin="0:32.395" end="0:35.494" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:32.395" end="0:32.579">時</span><span begin="0:32.579" end="0:32.915">刻</span> <span begin="0:32.915" end="0:33.509">10</span> <span begin="0:33.509" end="0:34.028">o'clock</span> <span begin="0:34.028" end="0:34.336">今日</span><span begin="0:34.336" end="0:34.576">も</span><span begin="0:34.576" en